dress that I ordered and when it came in I really didn&#039;t like it anymore. It&#039;s Kitty Chen Florence. It&#039;s a beautiful dress just isn&#039;t the fit I really wanted. It&#039;s a label size 6. Its corset back and will fit 0-8 I think. It&#039;s ivory but almost white. I had the neckline changed to sweetheart and a bustle added. I didn&#039;t alter the length or anything else. \n\n\nI think it&#039;s organza. The fabric is really light so don&#039;t worry about travel :-)\n\n\nHere&#039;s the link where I have it listed, but because I&#039;m trying to get money for another I&#039;ve seen, the price is negotiable:\n\n&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/148140\"&gt;https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/148140&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nPlease let me know if you&#039;re interested! Thx!","Attachments":[{"Id":33494,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-32408700-1440340228.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-32408700-1440340228_thumb.jpg","Width":125,"Height":125},{"Id":33495,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-74014900-1440340250.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-74014900-1440340250_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":1136},{"Id":33496,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-71650400-1440340264.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-71650400-1440340264_thumb.jpg","Width":125,"Height":125},{"Id":33497,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-40894600-1440340273.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-262240-0-40894600-1440340273_thumb.jpg","Width":125,"Height":125}],"Id":1903125,"PostDate":1440344455,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello brides,<br><br>\nI have a dress that I ordered and when it came in I really didn't like it anymore. It's Kitty Chen Florence. It's a beautiful dress just isn't the fit I really wanted. It's a label size 6. Its corset back and will fit 0-8 I think. It's ivory but almost white. I had the neckline changed to sweetheart and a bustle added. I didn't alter the length or anything else. <br><br>\nI think it's organza. The fabric is really light so don't worry about travel :-)<br><br>\nHere's the link where I have it listed, but because I'm trying to get money for another I've seen, the price is negotiable:<br><br><a href='https:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/dresses\/view\/148140' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.preowned...ses\/view\/148140<\/a><br><br>\nPlease let me know if you're interested! Thx!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352514105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"Ca