{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48aa9e596bb3c7f36f82859812654ccd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@steelbride&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s a gorgeous dress. I really like the uniqueness of the woven like pattern!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;hahah let us know how the mock dress shopping goes :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900737,"PostDate":1437331882,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@steelbride<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's a gorgeous dress. I really like the uniqueness of the woven like pattern!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>hahah let us know how the mock dress shopping goes <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.176.81.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1dad881b8c8b5e09965f6ba86ab71846","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks! I love the basketweave and the fluffy bottom on the dress and it&#039;s way lighter than it looks lol.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The manager at the David&#039;s Bridal said we could bring the dress over before we come back shopping with my mom. We&#039;ll try on really unflattering dresses and then my dress haha. She&#039;ll have to love it hopefully lol since it&#039;s a done deal. :) I can&#039;t deprive her of the experience though since I know she will be very disappointed if she isn&#039;t there.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900739,"PostDate":1437335129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! I love the basketweave and the fluffy bottom on the dress and it's way lighter than it looks lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The manager at the David's Bridal said we could bring the dress over before we come back shopping with my mom. We'll try on really unflattering dresses and then my dress haha. She'll have to love it hopefully lol since it's a done deal. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I can't deprive her of the experience though since I know she will be very disappointed if she isn't there.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah_e_collier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.176.60.154","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435226162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283685.jpg?_r=1437401496","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"streelbride","Id":283685,"Name":"streelbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.75.116.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79036,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d676d13c9a2faad2b28508d6ee4ed8eb","RawContent":"Love this topic. The dresses are BEAUTIFUL ladies!! Here are my pictures from my 1st dress fitting. Sorry, don&#039;t know to turn the picture around. : - )","Attachments":[{"Id":33110,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-271841-0-42899100-1437354391.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-271841-0-42899100-1437354391_thumb.jpg","Width":654,"Height":1200},{"Id":33111,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-271841-0-08337200-1437354418.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-271841-0-08337200-1437354418_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":747}],"Id":1900741,"PostDate":1437340243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love this topic. The dresses are BEAUTIFUL ladies!! Here are my pictures from my 1st dress fitting. Sorry, don't know to turn the picture around. : - )\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>",