='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/shop.nordstro...rm-_-proddescr1<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/37\/44\/48\/374448af4e32cc73bc77dbc08cb1b132.jpg\" alt=\"374448af4e32cc73bc77dbc08cb1b132.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natalie.zaval@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.184.87.109","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389117352,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275926.jpg?_r=1418313578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nattiegams325","Id":275926,"Name":"nattiegams325","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by rachelia160, 12 December 2014 - 09:34 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1418376895,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3752d41cacb2e60c6e0665a057559592","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nattiegams325\"] that dress is GORGEOUS! Absolutely love it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are mine:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ScreenShot2014-12-12at82640AM.png\" alt=\"ScreenShot2014-12-12at82640AM.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I LOVE long dresses, but I was worried my girls would be too hot, but this has a slit pretty far up the side to \"air them out\" :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got my two flower girl dresses online at David&#039;s Bridal for 50% of markdowns, which ended up being $20 a piece with free shipping! &amp;nbsp;They&#039;re still having that sale now if anyone is interested!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/8ee9728636bd76d6a216a421a5e3d73c.jpg\" alt=\"8ee9728636bd76d6a216a421a5e3d73c.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880213,"PostDate":1418376762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275926\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275926-nattiegams325\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nattiegams325<\/span><\/a> that dress is GORGEOUS! Absolutely love it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are mine:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ScreenShot2014-12-12at82640AM.png\" alt=\"ScreenShot2014-12-12at82640AM.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I LOVE long dresses, but I was worried my girls would be too hot, but this has a slit pretty far up the side to \"air them out\" <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got my two flower girl dresses online at David's Bridal for 50% of markdowns, which ended up being $20 a piece with free shipping! \u00a0They're still having that sale now if anyone is interested!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/8ee9728636bd76d6a216a421a5e3d73c.jpg\" alt=\"8ee9728636bd76d6a216a421a5e3d73c.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388717497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2315f2b536986c96b1a11d02d9c14d54","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nattiegams325\" post=\"1880183\" timestamp=\"1418351241\"]\nThis is my maid of honor&#039;s dress (not having bridemaids): It&#039;s erin fetherston coralie, here is the link [url=\"http:\/\/shop.nordstrom.com\/s\/erin-erin-fetherston-coralie-foiled-silk-chiffon-gown\/3740794?cm_em=&amp;amp;cm_mmc=email_tran-_-091914-_-ship_confirm-_-proddescr1\"]http:\/\/shop.nordstrom.com\/s\/erin-erin-fetherston-coralie-foiled-silk-chiffon-gown\/3740794?cm_em=&amp;amp;cm_mmc=email_tran-_-091914-_-ship_confirm-_-proddescr1[\/url]\n\n[img]https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/37\/44\/48\/374448af4e32cc73bc77dbc08cb1b132.jpg[\/img][\/quote]\nI LOVE THIS DRESS! I would love to wear this to my company Christmas party tomorrow. Hehe!  :P","Attachments":[],"Id":1880253,"PostDate":1418399557,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nattiegams325, on 11 December 2014 - 10:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This is my maid of honor's dress (not having bridemaids): It's erin fetherston coralie, here is the link <a href='http:\/\/shop.nordstrom.com\/s\/erin-erin-fetherston-coralie-foiled-silk-chiffon-gown\/3740794?cm_em=&cm_mmc=email_tran-_-091914-_-ship_confirm-_-proddescr1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/shop.nordstro...rm-_-proddescr1<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/37\/44\/48\/374448af4e32cc73bc77dbc08cb1b132.jpg\" alt=\"374448af4e32cc73bc77dbc08cb1b132.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I LOVE THIS DRESS! I would love to wear this to my company Christmas party tomorrow. Hehe!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411646662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22bdaac7e65cb4ece4f8685678c6a696","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rachelia160\" post=\"1880213\" timestamp=\"1418391162\"]\n@[member=\"nattiegams325\"] that dress is GORGEOUS! Absolutely love it!\n\nHere are mine:\n\n[img]http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ScreenShot2014-12-12at82640AM.png[\/img]\n\nI LOVE long dresses, but I was worried my girls would be too hot, but this has a slit pretty far up the side to \"air them out\" :)\n\nI got my two flower girl dresses online at David&#039;s Bridal for 50% of markdowns, which ended up being $20 a piece with free shipping!  They&#039;re still having that sale now if anyone is interested!\n\n[img]http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/8ee9728636bd76d6a216a421a5e3d73c.jpg[\/img][\/quote]very pretty!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1880600,"PostDate":1418824851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelia160, on 12 December 2014 - 09:32 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275926\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275926-nattiegams325\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nattiegams325<\/span><\/a> that dress is GORGEOUS! Absolutely love it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are mine:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ScreenShot2014-12-12at82640AM.png\" alt=\"ScreenShot2014-12-12at82640AM.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I LOVE long dresses, but I was worried my girls would be too hot, but this has a slit pretty far up the side to \"air them out\" <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got my two flower girl dresses online at David's Bridal for 50% of markdowns, which ended up being $20 a piece with free shipping! \u00a0They're still having that sale now if anyone is interested!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/8ee9728636bd76d6a216a421a5e3d73c.jpg\" alt=\"8ee9728636bd76d6a216a421a5e3d73c.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>very pretty!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.38.25.198","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"323d9e1316d276965c60de6594d8ec6c","RawContent":"My girls are all wearing teal and I said I want above the knee length. I was encouraging everyone to get what they want bc I wanted them to feel comfortable. I also like the way mismatched dresses look in photos. But one of the girls copied the other one, but just picked a diff shade of teal. I was annoyed but it wasn&#039;t worth the hassle to me of saying something.","Attachments":[],"Id":1881222,"PostDate":1419853365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My girls are all wearing teal and I said I want above the knee length. I was encouraging everyone to get what they want bc I wanted them to feel comfortable. I also like the way mismatched dresses look in photos. But one of the girls copied the other one, but just picked a diff shade of teal. I was annoyed but it wasn't worth the hassle to me of saying something. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403532989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by vancouverpetunia, 07 August 2015 - 10:56 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1438945005,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"240b757ec4df439d61bafaca54405ac7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is an old thread, but most recent I can find on BM dresses. What did\/have you picked for your maids? Where did you get the dresses? Please post!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m struggling a bit, as we all live in different cities (as well as different countries - US &amp;amp; Canada), so we will never be able to go shopping together. I was planning on choosing a color from David&#039;s and letting them pick their own dress, but I&#039;m not in love with the color options at David&#039;s. Online, I&#039;ve looked at Macy&#039;s, Nordstrom&#039;s, The Bay, Sears, BLHDN, J. Crew, Ann Taylor.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just found Weddington Way and requested a swatch from Alfredo Angelo. Could be a good option, as they have lots of styles in the same fabric &amp;amp; color. I need to investigate Target a bit more - they have what looks like a decent color (and good prices), but I&#039;m not sure how accurately the color is representated and also not sure about the quality of the dresses.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m looking for:&amp;nbsp;Teal;&amp;nbsp;Short;&amp;nbsp;Chiffon or other light fabric. I think the major issue is the color. I&#039;m finding that most colors are either blue or green (rather than kinda in the middle), or they are too light or too dark. I sound like Goldilocks.&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902080,"PostDate":1438944940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is an old thread, but most recent I can find on BM dresses. What did\/have you picked for your maids? Where did you get the dresses? Please post!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm struggling a bit, as we all live in different cities (as well as different countries - US & Canada), so we will never be able to go shopping together. I was planning on choosing a color from David's and letting them pick their own dress, but I'm not in love with the color options at David's. Online, I've looked at Macy's, Nordstrom's, The Bay, Sears, BLHDN, J. Crew, Ann Taylor.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just found Weddington Way and requested a swatch from Alfredo Angelo. Could be a good option, as they have lots of styles in the same fabric & color. I need to investigate Target a bit more - they have what looks like a decent color (and good prices), but I'm not sure how accurately the color is representated and also not sure about the quality of the dresses.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm looking for:\u00a0Teal;\u00a0Short;\u00a0Chiffon or other light fabric. I think the major issue is the color. I'm finding that most colors are either blue or green (rather than kinda in the middle), or they are too light or too dark. I sound like Goldilocks.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.102.57.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c2884d69788481c1e633448bd04a64b","RawContent":"\n\n\nThis is my maid of honors dress. So excited!!!! [emoji3] 8 months to go!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1902476,"PostDate":1439498944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902476]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284282-143951329949.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439513298.883450.jpg - Size: 81.95KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284282-143951329949.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439513298.883450.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902476]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284282-143951331024.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439513309.469707.jpg - Size: 120.23KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284282-143951331024.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439513309.469707.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nThis is my maid of honors dress. So excited!!!! [emoji3] 8 months to go!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lizzjameson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.72.162.21","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1438714755,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lizzjameson","Id":284282,"Name":"lizzjameson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"223.255.230.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a7d0ee640259244c9e6e19e7ebb9fe8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;the color is so nicee...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;for the accesories you can found on wallao,, thats many nice accessories there,, from head to toe.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902756,"PostDate":1439883299,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>the color is so nicee...<\/p>\n<p>for the accesories you can found on wallao,, thats many nice accessories there,, from head to toe.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430650422,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"32.213.186.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a5ae766fdef56f43b27c40240e2f2b3","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81911]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is what I have chosen as my bridesmaid dresses! &amp;nbsp;I am so excited I found them and they look great on all body types. &amp;nbsp;I wanted a pink dress, but I could not find the right color pink. &amp;nbsp;This is just perfect :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903110,"PostDate":1440273798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81911-bridesmaid-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18092\/sml_gallery_282291_18092_9428.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='bridesmaid dress'  width='131' height='200'  alt='bridesmaid dress' id='sml_image_view_81911' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is what I have chosen as my bridesmaid dresses! \u00a0I am so excited I found them and they look great on all body types. \u00a0I wanted a pink dress, but I could not find the right color pink. \u00a0This is just perfect <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"akutch23@gmail.com","IpAddress":"32.213.186.230","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425239763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282291.jpg?_r=1442363862","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Beachgirl622","Id":282291,"Name":"Beachgirl622","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.171.88.148","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78395,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a42fe505f926f34b59340db0c5e96787","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Beachgirl622\" post=\"1903110\" timestamp=\"1440288198\"]\nHere is what I have chosen as my bridesmaid dresses!  I am so excited I found them and they look great on all body types.  I wanted a pink dress, but I could not find the right color pink.  This is just perfect :)[\/quote]Where did to get this?  My sister and I are trying to find something similar for her.","Attachments":[],"Id":1903127,"PostDate":1440329323,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Beachgirl622, on 22 August 2015 - 08:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Here is what I have chosen as my bridesmaid dresses!  I am so excited I found them and they look great on all body types.  I wanted a pink dress, but I could not find the right color pink.  This is just perfect <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nWhere did to get this?  My sister and I are trying to find something similar for her.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread (Grand Sirenis 05.12.16)<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79418-joannabananas-planning-thread-may-12th-2016-grand-sirenis\/<\/a><p><br><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wSWQNi0\/weight.png\" alt=\"weight.png\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20160512\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f153\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1424042509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1441196917","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78395","Title":"Show Us Your Bridesmaids Attire","LastPostDate":1440888023},"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
