 in the Bahamas when we arrived, and we ended up changing the location from an outdoor patio area to an indoor conference room. &amp;nbsp;No time to decorate, so a lot of things did not get used. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Buyer pays shipping. &amp;nbsp;I live and work in the Washington DC\/Northern VA area, so would be willing to also meet someone for pickup. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Please let me know if you have any questions!!! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;90\" Round Organza Seamless Table Overlay \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Tiffany Blue - USED ONCE&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 25.00 (QTY 5)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;20\"x20\" Satin Napkins \u00e2\u20ac\u201c TiffanyBlue\/Aqua - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 25.00 (QTY 4 - 10 PCS PKS Plus extras from an opened pkg)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;12\u00e2\u20ac\u009dx116\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Organza Sash \u00e2\u20ac\u201c Ivory - NEW&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 50.00 (QTY 50)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;Wedding Tropics Linen Attire Samples&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria,serif;\"&gt;$ 10.00&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;sp