 hand sanitizer, etc. for each OOT Guest<\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 8.00 (QTY 8)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Centerpieces -- Yankee Candle Aqua Glass Tealight Holders - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">I bought these to use for Centerpieces, but was subsequently told by the Atlantis that I could not use any glass items for decorations as the Reception was outdoors on a patio.<\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 100.00 (QTY 5)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Centerpieces - Capiz Seashell Trays - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">*This price includes the trays and Tiffany Blue Sand and seashell, seaglass and starfish accessories - CANDLES NOT INCLUDED<\/span><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 75.00 (QTY 4)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Wishing Tree and Accessories - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 50.00<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> Tree Twig Glitter 32in Silver<\/p> <p> Crystal Garland Acrylic 5ft Clear (Qty 2)<\/p> <p> Light 20ct LED Bead Garland<\/p> <p> Framed Sign\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Sea Dune Grass Decorations - USED<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">$ 30.00 (QTY 2)<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#2a2a2a\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">2 White Starfish 3\" to 4\" w- Dried Dune Grass<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong><span  style=\"font-family:cambria,serif\">Light LED FloraLytes Submersible White - NEW<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span  style